# Zaffai and the Tempests only lets its controller cast an instant or sorcery spell from their own hand during their own turn
# (CR 118.9, 601.2). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with every source tapped. On Bot2's turn 2 Bot1's Lightning Bolt has no free cast to use
# and cannot be paid. On turn 3, with the permission unspent, Delver of Secrets (a creature, {U}) is refused too, and so is Bot2's own
# Lightning Bolt in Bot1's upkeep: it is not Bot1's hand. Bot1's Bolt is still free once it is a legal one - the permission was never
# used up by the refusals.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Zaffai and the Tempests
Lightning Bolt
Delver of Secrets
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x25

